WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.554 --> 00:00:02.910
(triumphant music)

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.900
- We're here at the TCL Chinese Theater

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.400
on historic Hollywood Boulevard,

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.229
otherwise known as the Walk of Fame.

00:00:12.229 --> 00:00:14.540
(people cheering)

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:18.510
So my grandfather, his
name is John Barrymore.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:22.420
He had a sister and a brother
named Ethel and Lionel

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.070
and they were known as the Barrymores.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.490
And he was also known
as the great profile,

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:29.640
or as he called it, pro-feel.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.020
He actually put his face in the cement

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:34.700
and it's the only one here that has it.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.360
But because he was known for his profile,

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.260
which I'm lucky enough to have inherited,

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.910
I am gonna do something I
always do when I come here.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.660
(whimsical orchestral music)

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:57.840
And sometimes our family isn't here.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.670
Although we didn't get to be together,

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.410
I've taken on the responsibility

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:07.230
to keep carrying out their
name and keep it alive.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:11.770
So this tiny piece of cement
is a way to stay close to him.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:14.140
And it means a lot to me.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.223
It's as close as I'm gonna get to him.

00:01:17.717 --> 00:01:20.384
(upbeat music)

